# Your Spotify app's Client ID (https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard).
#
# Set it here as .env.local for local development, and as an Environment Variable
# in the Vercel project for deployments. With it set, visitors just press
# "Connect Spotify"; without it, the app falls back to asking for a Client ID.
#
# PKCE has no client secret, so this is public by design — it ends up in the
# browser bundle either way. It lives in the environment rather than the repo so a
# fork does not inherit your app registration and its allowlist.
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
